          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- The Type I sum (4.29): `∑_{m ≤ D odd} μ(m) ∑_{n odd} e(αmn) η₂(mn/x)`. -/\nnoncomputable def typeI (α x D : ℝ) : ℂ :=\n  ∑ m ∈ Icc 1 ⌊D⌋₊, if Odd m then (μ m : ℂ) *\n    ∑ n ∈ Icc 1 ⌊x⌋₊, (if Odd n then e (α * m * n) * (eta2 (m * n / x) : ℂ) else 0) else 0",
